| Check println walker | `sid == "println" \|\| "eprintln"` then walk toks to RPAREN (`c_emit_secret.oo` L175–193). **Does not** require immediate LPAREN (optional skip). **Does not** call `c_secret_scan_call` or `c_secret_emit_guard` |
